# Git hygiene

- Never commit HF tokens, `.env`, datasets, checkpoints, or audio.
- Shared agent files that **are** committed: `AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/rules/**`, `.cursor/skills/**`.
- Commit only when the user asks; follow existing short commit style.
- Remote: `https://github.com/AdamCage/tts-self` (`origin/master`).
